# Source HDF5 density grids — 128 MB each, over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, and not
# needed to serve the site. These are the inputs the viz cubes under assets/viz/ are
# generated from; see "Regenerating the volume viz assets from HDF5" in README.md.
raw_data/*.h5

# Unreferenced alternate cut of the hero movie (21 MB); data.js uses Au6_500pc_interp.mp4.
raw_data/Au6_500pc_interp_square.mp4

# Pre-re-encode original of the ISM movie (74 MB). The 17.6 MB CRF 26 version is the one
# the site loads; this is kept locally only so the re-encode is reversible.
raw_data/*.orig.mp4

# Local editor / tooling state
.claude/
.DS_Store
